[[prediction]]
id = "P1"
measurement = "x"
range = [-0.4, -0.1]
label = "new-combination"
[prediction.when]
a0 = 0
a1 = 1
a2 = 0
a3 = 0
a4 = 0

[[prediction]]
id = "P2"
measurement = "x"
range = [-1.5, -0.1]
label = "new-combination"
[prediction.when]
a0 = 1
a1 = 1
a2 = 1
a3 = 1
a4 = 1
```

Notes: P1 follows the given R9 sign (positive a1 backs up). Tests whether c1 works at all on the positive side.
